{"id":821,"date":"2016-04-25T14:14:14","date_gmt":"2016-04-25T19:14:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=821"},"modified":"2016-04-23T14:15:02","modified_gmt":"2016-04-23T19:15:02","slug":"what-a-great-eatery-nichols-west","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/25\/what-a-great-eatery-nichols-west\/","title":{"rendered":"What a GREAT Eatery! &#8211; Nichols West"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>So some of the other campers here at The North Ranch told us about a great little restaurant just up the road in &#8220;downtown&#8221; Congress, AZ. \u00a0The town of Congress has; a gas station\/convenience store, a post office, an auto repair shop, and little else.<\/p>\n<p>But nestled right next door to the auto repair shop, visitors to the area will discover a very popular local eatery (looks like a little old diner) known as &#8220;Nichols West&#8221;.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-821 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-51-28.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-51-28-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-20-49.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-20-49-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-20-44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-20-44-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-09-13.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-09-13-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-08-52.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-20-11-08-52-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Simon, along with his wife and crew, put out a great menu of other than typical southwest cooking. \u00a0You see, Simon came over to the states from London, England 37 years ago and ultimately developed and ran 3 restaurants in the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hamptons.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Hamptons<\/a>. \u00a0At some point, they leased out the restaurants there and, having made a short year-long stop in Zanesville, OH ultimately came out to Congress and opened this upscale <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">eclectic<\/span> (there&#8217;s that word) little restaurant\/bar that offers both inside and outside (on the patio) seating.<\/p>\n<p>We went there twice. \u00a0Once for lunch when I had their Shrimp Tempura and Kathy had a spinach\/strawberry\/mango salad. \u00a0Our 2nd visit was last night for a late dinner after spending the day with Paul and Sue Middaugh up in Sedona. \u00a0There&#8217;s another post on our trip to Sedona.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>So some of the other campers here at The North Ranch told us about a great little restaurant just up the road in &#8220;downtown&#8221; Congress, AZ. \u00a0The town of Congress has; a gas station\/convenience store, a post office, an auto repair shop, and little else. But nestled right next door to the auto repair shop, &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/25\/what-a-great-eatery-nichols-west\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">What a GREAT Eatery! &#8211; Nichols West<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,677,19546],"tags":[13789,556146,16231,486748063],"class_list":["post-821","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-friends","category-sightseeing","tag-dinner","tag-eatery","tag-lunch","tag-nichols-west"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/821","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=821"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/821\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":947,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/821\/revisions\/947"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=821"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":tr